        {
          "source": "fda-verquvo",
          "section": "2.1"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "text": {
            "fa": "با غذا. در خطر افت فشار علامت‌دار: شروع ۲٫۵ mg. زن در سن باروری: تست بارداری پیش از شروع.",
            "en": "With food. At risk of symptomatic hypotension: start 2.5 mg. Females of reproductive potential: pregnancy test before starting."
          },
          "refs": [
            {
              "source": "fda-verquvo",
              "section": "2.1"
            },
            {
              "source": "fda-verquvo",
              "section": "2.2"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
